{"id":"vod_bf_19057","vodId":"19057","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"来自新世界","name_cn":"来自新世界","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-20/e98c021ff5eedded6816e5132954fadb.jpg"},"summary":"《来自新世界》改编自贵志祐介所著的科幻类小说作品。　　1000年后的日本，孩子们不断地消失，只存在想象中的恐怖动物与人类展开殊死战争。反乌托邦式的未来超级社会“新世界”，是口吐真言凭藉“咒力”就能移动物体的人类，与有著等同于普通人智力的生物“妖鼠”共存的世界。乍看之下一切和平，但“新世界”的孩子们的行动被彻底地控制和管束著，不合适的记忆被消去，被认为有问题的孩子，如同不良产品般被分开处理。得到被称为“咒力”的特殊能力的人们在“八丁标”的结界中促成一个小小的团体，无论是思想还是对外界的认知，记忆、爱、甚至生命的支配都被统治着。在这其中，渡辺早季、朝比奈覚、秋月真理亜、伊东守、青沼瞬五位少年和少女们，为了守护日益衰弱的世界和同伴，投身到了各种各样的冒险的旅程中......","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"剧情,动画,情,日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 06:02:28","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laizixinshijie/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laizixinshijie/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laizixinshijie/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laizixinshijie/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laizixinshijie/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laizixinshijie/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laizixinshijie/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laizixinshijie/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laizixinshijie/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laizixinshijie/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laizixinshijie/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laizixinshijie/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laizixinshijie/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.rrcd